DTEND:20261006T121111Z
SUMMARY:The Moon occults Jupiter
DESCRIPTION:Jupiter disappears at 14:40:28 and reappears at 15:09:31 EAT\, 
 seen from Kakamega\, KE.\nThe Moon is 8° up in the WNW · daylight\, Sun 
 +57°.\nTimes against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at 
 the Moon's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/jupiter-2026-10-06?city=Kakamega
 %2C%20KE
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/jupiter-2026-10-06?city=Kakamega%2C%20KE
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
